# https://github.com/jerrykuku/luci-theme-argon
# Keep the login page's background local. Out of the box it asks Bing for its
# picture of the day every time the page is shown.
# Which theme LuCI starts with is LUCI_THEME, set in 99-uci_config.
uci -q batch << EOI
set argon.@global[0].online_wallpaper="none"
commit argon
EOI
